{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q3621245","formula":"ZnMn₁₂Fe₂(AsO₃)(AsO₄)₂(OH)₂₃","hill":"As3Fe2H23Mn12O34Zn","elements":["H","O","Mn","Fe","Zn","As"],"composition":{"H":23.0,"O":34.0,"As":3.0,"Fe":2.0,"Mn":12.0,"Zn":1.0},"names":{"en":"Arakiite","uk":"Аракіїт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Arakiite (IMA symbol: Ark) is a rare mineral with the formula (Zn,Mn2+)(Mn2+,Mg)12(Fe3+,Al)2(As3+O3)(As5+O4)2(OH)23. It is both arsenate and arsenite mineral, a combination that is rare in the world of minerals. Arakiite is stoichiometrically similar to hematolite.","uk":"Аракіїт — рідкісний мінерал із формулою (Zn, Mn2+)(Mn2+,Mg)12(Fe3+,Al)2(As3+O3)(As5+O4)2(OH)23. Це і арсенат, і арсеніт, поєднання яких рідко зустрічається у світі мінералів. Аракіїт стехіометрично подібний до гематоліту."},"fame":6,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3621245","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arakiite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%90%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%96%D1%97%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q777377","formula":"Mn₄H₆O₁₀","names":{"en":"Aurorite"},"elements":["H","O","Mn"],"fame":9,"kind":null},{"id":"Q420570","formula":"Mn₅(AsO₄)₂(OH)₄·4H₂O","names":{"en":"Akrochordite","ru":"Акрохордит","uk":"Акрохордит"},"elements":["H","O","Mn","As"],"fame":13,"kind":null},{"id":"Q617097","formula":"Mn₃ZnH₆O₁₀","names":{"en":"Chalcophanite","ru":"Халькофанит","uk":"Халькофаніт"},"elements":["H","O","Mn","Zn"],"fame":10,"kind":null},{"id":"Q401047","formula":"MnO(OH)","names":{"en":"Manganite","ru":"Манганит","uk":"Манґаніт"},"elements":["H","O","Mn